    "body": "Thanks! @rniwa do you have any thoughts on order? I looked this through with Edgar and either way we are going to change the order here in order to centralize some of this work for \"replace all\". I don't care strongly for which slot we signal things first.\r\n\r\nAnd also, given that browsers are already different, it probably does not matter much?\r\n\r\nNot sure who to copy from Chrome. @domenic?",
